        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+---------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                   THE BAUHAUS (1919-1933)                     |\n|                                                               |\n|  WEIMAR 1919-1925   DESSAU 1925-1932   BERLIN 1932-1933       |\n|  (Gropius)          (Gropius -> Meyer  (Mies van der Rohe)    |\n|                      -> Mies)                                 |\n|                                                               |\n|  THESIS: Unify fine art, craft, and industrial production     |\n|  under a single educational and aesthetic framework           |\n|                                                               |\n|  CLOSED: Nazis declared it degenerate / communist             |\n|  DIASPORA: Staff scattered to USA -> shaped American design   |\n+---------------------------------------------------------------+\n               |\n               v\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n|  LEGACY CHANNELS                              |\n|                                               |\n|  -> Art education (Foundation Course model)   |\n|  -> Corporate identity (IBM, etc.)            |\n|  -> Architecture (International Style)        |\n|  -> Typography (geometric sans-serifs)        |\n|  -> Industrial design (form follows function) |\n+-----------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
