      },
      "text": "Before the Bauhaus, European art education split along two tracks:\n- **Fine arts academies**: painting, sculpture, \"pure\" art\n- **Technical schools**: applied craft, trades"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-BAUHAUS.md#006",
      "path": [
        "01-BAUHAUS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
