        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Bauhaus: Total Design and the School",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The Bauhaus declared this split false and damaging. Gropius's founding manifesto\n(1919) opened: \"The ultimate aim of all creative activity is building!\""
    },
