        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Bauhaus: Total Design and the School",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nBAUHAUS TYPOGRAPHY PRINCIPLES\n------------------------------\n- Geometric construction (circle, square, triangle as basis)\n- Sans-serif favored (no historical ornament)\n- Grid alignment\n- Red + black two-color printing (Soviet-influenced)\n- Text + image as unified design field"
    },
