      "text": "FAMOUS TYPEFACES FROM THIS TRADITION\n- Futura (1927) -- Paul Renner, not Bauhaus but same moment\n- Bauhaus (ITC Bauhaus) -- later revival\n- Universal -- Bayer's lowercase experiment\n```"
    },
