        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nWEIMAR (1919-1925)\n  Tone: Expressive, arts-and-crafts inflected\n  Itten's mysticism vs. Gropius's functionalism\n  Klee, Kandinsky dominate painting workshops\n  Output: Still handcraft-oriented"
    },
    {
      "id": "01-BAUHAUS.md#034",
      "path": [
        "01-BAUHAUS.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[mdloom-backfill:graphic-design:01-bauhaus, git-history:graphic-design:01-bauhaus]",
