        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Bauhaus: Total Design and the School",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BERLIN (1932-1933)\n  Tone: Survival; politically beleaguered\n  Private school (city funding cut)\n  Closed July 1933 by vote of masters under Nazi pressure\n  Output: 14 years of work; ideas scatter globally\n```"
    },
